WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:40.900 --> 01:44.200
[Marriage Division, Celestial Court]

01:44.200 --> 01:51.210
♪Birds in the trees fly in pairs♪

01:51.310 --> 01:55.050
Liu Yan'er, Wang Qi.

01:55.050 --> 01:56.070
[Liu Yan'er Wang Qi]

01:56.070 --> 01:58.770
I'll bind you two tighter.

01:58.790 --> 02:02.490
May you grow old together.

02:02.640 --> 02:07.290
♪Green hills and waters smile♪

02:09.310 --> 02:11.060
Another pair made.

02:11.310 --> 02:14.380
Fate sees all. Fate sees all!

02:18.630 --> 02:19.410
[Grand Mage of Voidcity]
Grand Mage.

02:19.410 --> 02:20.660
[Supreme Elder's first disciple,
Three Sects of the Way]

02:21.000 --> 02:21.780
Old man,

02:22.360 --> 02:23.690
I just had a dream.

02:24.030 --> 02:25.540
I dreamed that by Mentor's order,

02:25.560 --> 02:28.060
I came here to boost human procreation.

02:28.080 --> 02:30.410
The results are quite pleasing.

02:30.960 --> 02:33.410
Grand Mage, this is no dream.

02:33.560 --> 02:36.500
Perhaps you are actually here for this,

02:36.840 --> 02:39.690
but you fell asleep after arriving

02:39.710 --> 02:41.100
at Ascendance Sect, East Land.

02:43.840 --> 02:45.340
Then I'll take a short rest and return.

02:45.360 --> 02:46.660
Grand Mage, Grand Mage.

02:46.910 --> 02:48.820
You've already taken three naps.

02:49.120 --> 02:51.450
Please, do some proper work.

02:51.630 --> 02:53.730
If this delays
the Human Sect's marriages,

02:53.750 --> 02:55.570
Eastwood Duke won't let me off.

02:56.030 --> 02:57.290
Eastwood Duke?

02:59.030 --> 02:59.780
Eastwood Duke is no trouble.

03:00.310 --> 03:01.100
Grand Mage, Grand Mage.

03:01.120 --> 03:01.780
Please, please.

03:01.800 --> 03:02.890
Please, look.

03:04.150 --> 03:04.890
This is

03:04.910 --> 03:07.100
the Book of Marriages
of Ascendance Sect.

03:07.120 --> 03:07.890
Please, take a look.

03:09.750 --> 03:10.890
On this

03:11.120 --> 03:14.660
are recorded all birth dates

03:14.710 --> 03:16.100
and names

03:16.120 --> 03:17.570
of the couples.

03:26.470 --> 03:29.100
I never imagined
that over these centuries,

03:29.430 --> 03:30.820
our Ascendance Sect
would have so many couples.

03:30.960 --> 03:31.780
No, no.

03:32.710 --> 03:33.660
This right here

03:33.680 --> 03:35.820
is just from the past three months.

03:38.030 --> 03:38.540
This

03:39.400 --> 03:40.980
is from the past several centuries.

03:40.980 --> 03:42.260
[Book of Marriages of Ascendance Sect]

03:45.520 --> 03:46.290
That's it?

03:54.430 --> 03:55.500
Were you dozing off?

03:55.710 --> 03:57.060
I wouldn't dare.

03:57.360 --> 03:58.730
It's empty inside.

03:58.960 --> 04:00.690
Over the past centuries,

04:00.750 --> 04:03.380
your Ascendance Sect hasn't had
a single match.

04:03.680 --> 04:06.690
But in just the past three months,

04:06.710 --> 04:08.890
480 couples have formed.

04:09.000 --> 04:11.100
480 couples...

04:11.870 --> 04:13.820
Ones, tens, hundreds, thousands.

04:15.560 --> 04:16.290
Four hundred and eighty.

04:16.310 --> 04:17.580
Grand Mage, you're so clever!

04:18.310 --> 04:19.730
From what I've observed,

04:19.750 --> 04:21.140
all these love matches

04:21.160 --> 04:23.020
come from a single new sprout.

04:23.160 --> 04:26.100
This sprout has sparked many matches,

04:26.120 --> 04:28.370
yet it itself remains untouched.

04:28.510 --> 04:31.220
He's got three admirers.

04:31.240 --> 04:31.980
Admirers?

04:37.510 --> 04:38.810
But he rejected all of them.

04:38.830 --> 04:40.900
This is not an easy thing.

04:40.920 --> 04:42.020
The admirers are trying.

04:42.310 --> 04:42.980
Look.

04:54.270 --> 04:56.250
I think this virtuous talent

04:56.560 --> 04:58.490
must be calm and self-restraint.

04:58.800 --> 04:59.490
That's why

04:59.510 --> 05:02.490
he turned down three fine matches.

05:04.430 --> 05:06.290
How amusing!

05:07.750 --> 05:09.700
Why not invite the Moon Elder

05:09.870 --> 05:11.100
to bring them together?

05:12.360 --> 05:13.170
Grand Mage,

05:14.480 --> 05:16.780
actually, I am the Moon Elder.

05:17.040 --> 05:17.930
You are the Moon Elder?

05:17.950 --> 05:19.020
So, you're the Moon Elder!

05:21.000 --> 05:21.780
Nice to meet you.

05:22.680 --> 05:23.700
How nice indeed.

05:23.950 --> 05:25.250
If you're the Moon Elder,

05:25.310 --> 05:27.220
why don't you just tie them together?

05:27.510 --> 05:29.220
That won't do, that won't do.

05:29.480 --> 05:31.290
The Marriage Division can only assist

05:31.630 --> 05:33.850
the marriage destinies
of all living beings.

05:33.950 --> 05:35.250
It must not be forced.

05:38.630 --> 05:40.460
I never imagined
that in our Way lineage,

05:41.120 --> 05:42.490
there is such a fascinating person.

05:42.720 --> 05:44.610
What is this person's name?

05:46.510 --> 05:47.490
Li Changshou,

05:47.750 --> 05:48.980
Jade Division,

05:49.680 --> 05:50.490
Ascendance Sect.

05:53.100 --> 05:55.380
[Li Changshou]

05:56.420 --> 05:59.340
[Episode 5]

06:09.510 --> 06:11.100
You still can't channel your power?

06:11.480 --> 06:12.900
Every time I try to channel it,

06:13.270 --> 06:15.220
I recall Yuan Qing's words that day.

06:20.160 --> 06:21.700
What did Yuan Qing say?

06:22.560 --> 06:23.340
He said

06:23.920 --> 06:26.020
that I don't know what this sword means,

06:26.040 --> 06:27.490
nor why I wield it.

06:27.920 --> 06:30.100
This question has been troubling me,

06:30.630 --> 06:32.220
keeping me from using this new sword

06:32.240 --> 06:33.250
to release my power.

06:35.120 --> 06:35.900
It's alright.

06:36.240 --> 06:37.050
Maybe

06:37.070 --> 06:39.290
this sword just isn't right for you.

06:42.430 --> 06:43.850
You have the Firescale Sword, right?

06:44.430 --> 06:46.900
The edge and tip are broken.
I buried it.

06:47.040 --> 06:47.810
You buried it?

06:49.120 --> 06:50.170
Let it be buried then.

06:50.480 --> 06:52.370
You'll surely find a better one.

06:58.630 --> 06:59.610
If the heart is there,

07:01.040 --> 07:02.170
the sword is there.

07:03.630 --> 07:04.490
Please take your leave.

07:05.510 --> 07:06.700
Heart...

07:08.510 --> 07:09.140
Senior,

07:09.160 --> 07:10.490
isn't that a bit too dismissive?

07:10.920 --> 07:11.810
She's venomous.

07:11.920 --> 07:13.340
She's worse than the Gnatsting Needle.

07:13.360 --> 07:14.580
We have to steer clear.

07:14.750 --> 07:15.580
I understand.

07:18.070 --> 07:18.900
You even understand that?

07:20.240 --> 07:22.610
Your sword isn't tangible.

07:22.720 --> 07:24.700
It's a Qi refiner's inner righteousness.

07:24.830 --> 07:26.900
The sword-bearer relies
not on the blade,

07:26.950 --> 07:28.370
but on a righteous spirit.

07:29.070 --> 07:30.660
Your lesson is spot on.

07:30.870 --> 07:32.490
I'm truly convinced.

07:40.870 --> 07:42.100
This is my junior. Ask her.

07:42.120 --> 07:43.050
I'll leave her to you.

07:43.050 --> 07:44.060
[Hall of United Spirits]

07:45.120 --> 07:46.020
Senior, he...

07:48.310 --> 07:49.100
Senior...

07:51.240 --> 07:52.930
He's just like that.

07:52.950 --> 07:55.020
He'll chat and then suddenly scowl.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.100
Once you've spent more time with him,

07:57.120 --> 07:58.290
you'll surely dislike it.

07:59.430 --> 08:01.810
Kindred souls value a knowing heart.

08:02.480 --> 08:05.100
So carefree and noble.

08:05.160 --> 08:07.980
Truly a lofty vision, a broad mind.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.020
Senior Youqin,

08:12.270 --> 08:13.980
you know so many idioms!

08:15.120 --> 08:15.980
Just a little.

08:17.310 --> 08:18.100
Junior,

08:18.560 --> 08:21.410
may I come visit often?

08:21.680 --> 08:22.290
Often?

08:24.040 --> 08:24.700
Look at me.

08:24.720 --> 08:26.050
Every day, I have to sweep, mop,

08:26.070 --> 08:27.100
[Hall of United Spirits]
and wipe tables.

08:27.120 --> 08:28.460
I lit all those candles, you know.

08:28.750 --> 08:31.020
I'm so tired my back is killing me.

08:31.360 --> 08:34.980
You gotta pay me for all this work.

08:37.080 --> 08:38.980
Fifty a day.

08:42.120 --> 08:42.890
One hundred.

08:47.440 --> 08:48.300
I don't have change.

08:48.480 --> 08:50.770
How about I pay for fifty years upfront?

08:54.360 --> 08:55.770
Forget spirit stones; it's no big deal.

08:55.790 --> 08:56.610
It's all the same.

08:56.630 --> 08:57.890
But our division

08:57.910 --> 08:59.700
hasn't had an outsider in years.

09:00.960 --> 09:01.530
Jiu...

09:01.910 --> 09:02.890
Aunt Jiu Jiu.

09:04.910 --> 09:06.060
Is Changshou here?

09:06.080 --> 09:07.300
Does he have a project or something

09:07.320 --> 09:08.460
that needs my help?

09:09.240 --> 09:10.010
He...

09:10.320 --> 09:11.300
He went out.

09:12.270 --> 09:13.820
Senior sure loves giving orders.

09:13.960 --> 09:15.130
Aunt Jiu Jiu lives for her wine.

09:15.390 --> 09:16.730
With wine, she'll gladly help.

09:17.440 --> 09:20.060
Did she pay spirit stones too?

09:22.000 --> 09:22.770
She...

09:23.320 --> 09:24.100
She...

09:25.270 --> 09:26.700
Isn't she here to help?

09:26.720 --> 09:29.250
She's paying with labor.

09:30.120 --> 09:30.610
Right.

09:34.550 --> 09:35.490
Aunt, over there.

09:35.870 --> 09:37.100
A bit to your left. There.

09:37.390 --> 09:38.180
[South Qian]
Three pieces.

09:39.200 --> 09:39.700
Right.

09:43.510 --> 09:44.850
Three more pieces on the right.

09:47.870 --> 09:49.010
And in front of you.

09:49.030 --> 09:50.220
[Five, Heaven, Ten, Earth]
Three pieces there.

09:55.150 --> 09:56.490
Line them up a little more.

09:57.000 --> 09:57.770
All right, all right.

10:04.630 --> 10:06.820
Li Changshou!

10:07.550 --> 10:08.530
Keep going.

10:09.030 --> 10:10.010
Yes.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.890
I'm worn out.

10:22.440 --> 10:23.490
You're amazing.

10:23.840 --> 10:25.610
Three ten-thousandths done.

10:25.630 --> 10:26.580
What did you say?

10:26.790 --> 10:27.610
Li Changshou,

10:27.790 --> 10:29.220
you call this a small task?

10:29.550 --> 10:30.490
28 binding arrays.

10:30.510 --> 10:31.530
76 hidden nodes.

10:31.550 --> 10:33.220
Purplegold Array Plate,
Perpetual Motion Millstone.

10:33.240 --> 10:34.890
Even the sect's grand array
isn't this complete.

10:34.910 --> 10:35.820
What are you really planning?

10:36.030 --> 10:37.730
How could it rival the grand array?

10:38.030 --> 10:40.370
I merely seek some convenience.

10:40.390 --> 10:41.700
For the Sky-Scraping Vine,

10:42.000 --> 10:43.340
I crossed a powerful figure.

10:43.390 --> 10:44.730
I have to be prepared.

10:45.550 --> 10:47.060
Why bring this trouble to me

10:47.080 --> 10:48.180
when I abstain from wine??

10:48.200 --> 10:49.010
Heavens.

10:49.080 --> 10:50.580
Are you trying to end me?

10:50.600 --> 10:52.180
I know quitting wine is hard.

10:52.440 --> 10:53.460
Nonsense.

10:53.480 --> 10:58.100
This is worse
than getting struck by lightning.

11:11.870 --> 11:12.820
I can't touch it.

11:13.600 --> 11:14.580
I've quit drinking.

11:14.790 --> 11:16.580
Uncle, this isn't alcohol.

11:16.960 --> 11:19.580
This is my exclusive original creation:

11:19.600 --> 11:20.890
Captivating Brew.

11:21.360 --> 11:24.010
The perfect substitute.
Satisfaction guaranteed.

11:26.960 --> 11:29.420
I still can't touch it.

11:37.870 --> 11:38.650
Changshou,

11:39.750 --> 11:40.940
from today on,

11:41.240 --> 11:42.420
we'll each use our own titles.

11:43.840 --> 11:44.980
You call me Aunt,

11:45.630 --> 11:46.820
and I'll call you Brother.

11:48.080 --> 11:49.580
Brother? Let's skip that.

11:50.240 --> 11:51.370
But lately,

11:51.600 --> 11:53.820
I've been busy with preparations.

11:54.200 --> 11:55.370
I'm anxious to advance my cultivation.

11:55.440 --> 11:56.730
As for these physical tasks...

11:58.360 --> 11:59.130
I'll take care of them.

11:59.240 --> 12:00.820
Leave it all to me.

12:01.270 --> 12:02.180
Rest assured.

12:14.840 --> 12:15.610
Grand Mage,

12:15.870 --> 12:17.820
with all this sweet talk,

12:18.480 --> 12:20.580
how could he resist?

12:23.480 --> 12:24.300
It seems

12:25.750 --> 12:27.370
that to enlighten that stubborn stone,

12:27.390 --> 12:29.890
we must rely on the Tree of Yearning.

12:31.080 --> 12:32.130
But

12:32.480 --> 12:34.420
for a trivial mortal romance,

12:34.600 --> 12:36.220
this office has no precedent

12:36.440 --> 12:38.820
to use such a sacred object.

12:39.360 --> 12:40.130
Grand Mage,

12:40.670 --> 12:41.820
what do you think?

12:41.870 --> 12:42.890
I think

12:43.270 --> 12:46.530
precedents are meant to be broken.

12:47.550 --> 12:48.580
Look at the three...

12:49.630 --> 12:50.420
Three stars.

12:50.440 --> 12:51.340
Three admirers.

12:51.360 --> 12:52.420
Yeah, three pillars.

12:52.790 --> 12:54.530
It was heaven's will, after all.

12:54.550 --> 12:55.820
We must not waste it.

12:56.270 --> 12:57.220
Moreover,

12:57.440 --> 12:59.010
this is for the Human Clan's prosperity.

13:00.630 --> 13:01.420
It's understandable.

13:02.200 --> 13:02.980
Grand Mage,

13:03.440 --> 13:04.820
with your words,

13:06.030 --> 13:07.490
I will dare to act on it.

13:20.320 --> 13:21.100
Go!

13:22.500 --> 13:25.420
[Hall of United Spirits]

13:56.840 --> 13:57.820
An illusion.

14:00.270 --> 14:02.010
Such a real illusion.

14:03.670 --> 14:05.420
Could it be Fairy Yunxiao?

14:07.390 --> 14:09.530
Just for a piece of Sky-Scraping Vine,

14:09.550 --> 14:11.130
she wants to break my cultivation?

14:11.870 --> 14:13.220
How can she do that?

14:13.390 --> 14:15.370
Here goes the Everlasting Bond.

14:17.180 --> 14:18.600
[Lan Ling'e]

14:18.600 --> 14:19.370
Senior.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.060
Senior.

14:29.200 --> 14:29.980
Senior.

14:33.630 --> 14:34.890
What kind of twisted thought is this?

14:35.270 --> 14:36.220
Illusion, disperse!

14:36.240 --> 14:36.890
Break!

14:40.030 --> 14:41.700
Everlasting Bond!

14:43.980 --> 14:45.140
[Youqin Xuanya]

14:45.270 --> 14:45.940
Senior.

14:54.440 --> 14:55.490
Senior Changshou,

14:56.390 --> 14:57.980
if I had a boat ticket,

14:59.080 --> 15:00.530
would you come with me?

15:01.270 --> 15:02.220
Not a chance.

15:02.870 --> 15:03.650
Break!

15:03.940 --> 15:06.370
♪I grasp the vast firmament♪

15:06.370 --> 15:08.120
♪Karma never falls empty♪

15:09.390 --> 15:09.890
I...

15:10.960 --> 15:12.100
Everlasting Bond!

15:13.180 --> 15:14.300
[Jiu Jiu]

15:14.910 --> 15:16.010
Changshou.

15:29.240 --> 15:30.460
Changshou.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.130
Do you want to go for a ride?

15:35.440 --> 15:36.220
Break!

15:40.000 --> 15:41.100
You brat.

15:41.630 --> 15:43.010
I don't believe it.

15:43.960 --> 15:44.850
Alright, that's enough.

15:44.870 --> 15:46.250
Stop embarrassing yourself

15:46.270 --> 15:47.420
before the Grand Mage.

15:47.440 --> 15:48.220
Eastwood Duke.

15:48.390 --> 15:48.850
You...

15:50.480 --> 15:51.250
Grand Mage.

15:52.080 --> 15:53.370
Look at yourself.

15:53.390 --> 15:54.730
I was just about to praise you.

15:54.750 --> 15:56.530
The Marriage Division's results
have soared lately.

15:56.550 --> 15:58.340
I thought you'd finally improved.

15:58.360 --> 15:59.580
I never thought
you couldn't even handle

15:59.600 --> 16:00.420
such a small matter.

16:02.440 --> 16:04.340
Eastwood Duke, what brings you here?

16:04.360 --> 16:05.610
How could I not come?

16:06.080 --> 16:07.010
Put some effort in.

16:07.480 --> 16:08.820
Don't let the Grand Mage of Voidcity

16:08.840 --> 16:10.010
make a mockery of our Celestial Court.

16:10.030 --> 16:11.220
Put some effort in?

16:11.240 --> 16:12.010
But he...

16:12.030 --> 16:12.770
Back off.

16:12.790 --> 16:13.770
This... he...

16:21.270 --> 16:22.100
Grand Mage.

16:23.600 --> 16:24.890
You be careful too.

16:26.550 --> 16:27.130
You...

16:27.750 --> 16:29.100
Three steps back.

16:44.960 --> 16:46.420
As expected of the immortals.

16:46.440 --> 16:48.130
They saw through my fear of karma,

16:48.150 --> 16:49.180
hitting me where it hurts.

16:50.510 --> 16:51.550
Hey.

16:53.550 --> 16:55.130
No gifts this holiday.

16:55.960 --> 16:58.370
Let's just spend some time together.

16:59.000 --> 17:01.010
Just open your eyes and look at me.

17:01.910 --> 17:03.650
I don't believe
you have no feelings for me.

17:04.550 --> 17:05.810
See you tomorrow.

17:05.830 --> 17:07.380
See you every day.

17:10.160 --> 17:11.620
Immortals, your move is formidable.

17:11.790 --> 17:13.900
Bet I still have my trump card.

17:15.260 --> 17:17.780
[Lifespan Filter:
Portrait of Old Beauties]

17:22.350 --> 17:25.090
Flowers fade; all must age.

17:25.960 --> 17:28.900
Greed, anger, folly, love,
do not bother me.

17:31.480 --> 17:32.250
Break!

17:38.880 --> 17:39.660
Eastwood Duke.

17:39.680 --> 17:40.940
Eastwood Duke, are you alright?

17:45.720 --> 17:46.490
Eastwood Duke.

17:46.790 --> 17:47.770
Are you alright, Eastwood Duke?

17:48.480 --> 17:49.460
Are you alright, Eastwood Duke?

17:50.790 --> 17:52.010
His aspiration for the Way

17:52.480 --> 17:54.250
is simply indestructible.

17:54.680 --> 17:56.050
A rarity for all ages.

17:56.200 --> 17:56.860
How admirable.

17:57.720 --> 17:59.050
How terrifying.

17:59.310 --> 18:01.660
This clever one, start already.

18:01.920 --> 18:03.090
It's already over.

18:04.880 --> 18:05.660
Moon Elder,

18:05.720 --> 18:06.900
he's actually more formidable than you.

18:07.920 --> 18:09.620
Grand Mage, you're insulting me!

18:10.480 --> 18:11.570
Well, in that case,

18:12.480 --> 18:13.860
let me try.

18:13.880 --> 18:14.730
Look!

18:15.640 --> 18:17.570
He bested the Demon Emperor

18:17.680 --> 18:19.860
and saved the Six Clans.

18:21.070 --> 18:22.620
Though often carefree,

18:22.640 --> 18:24.180
when the moment counts,

18:24.200 --> 18:26.570
his noble bearing appears,

18:26.680 --> 18:28.620
with mighty power.

18:50.880 --> 18:51.660
I...

18:57.480 --> 18:58.460
What's wrong with my arm?

18:58.790 --> 18:59.570
My arm...

19:00.550 --> 19:01.330
Senior.

19:01.680 --> 19:02.570
Are you all right?

19:03.720 --> 19:05.380
I'm fine.

19:06.720 --> 19:07.770
Are you truly fine?

19:08.880 --> 19:09.900
I really am.

19:10.160 --> 19:10.790
- Truly?
- Senior.

19:10.790 --> 19:12.100
- I'm fine.
- Let me look.

19:12.120 --> 19:12.860
- I'm fine.
- What of your arm?

19:12.880 --> 19:13.450
- I'm fine.
- What of your arm?

19:13.470 --> 19:13.730
Senior.

19:13.750 --> 19:14.210
I'm fine.

19:14.230 --> 19:14.860
Let me see.

19:14.880 --> 19:15.370
- I'm fine.
- Senior.

19:15.390 --> 19:16.410
- Your arm?
- Senior.

19:16.410 --> 19:17.560
You look far from fine.

19:17.560 --> 19:18.020
I'm truly fine.

19:18.040 --> 19:19.020
- Are you sure?
- I am.

19:19.040 --> 19:20.130
Something's wrong with your arm.

19:20.150 --> 19:20.820
My arm is fine.

19:20.840 --> 19:22.020
- Another illusion!
- You're hurt!

19:22.040 --> 19:23.160
- Break!
- Senior, you're hurt!

19:23.160 --> 19:23.660
Senior.

19:24.230 --> 19:24.980
Are you all right?

19:25.230 --> 19:25.890
Senior.

19:26.200 --> 19:27.690
Break! Break!

19:28.040 --> 19:29.340
If I can't break it, then...

19:30.000 --> 19:30.370
Run!

19:37.480 --> 19:39.220
What is he trying to break?

19:40.480 --> 19:42.860
His words are so deep.

19:44.270 --> 19:45.570
Yes, a bit mystical.

19:46.070 --> 19:46.860
So mystical.

19:49.510 --> 19:51.010
Sorry, sorry.

19:53.680 --> 19:54.570
After all,

19:54.590 --> 19:57.010
we were too hasty,

19:57.480 --> 19:59.530
causing that mortal to lose his arm.

20:00.640 --> 20:01.420
No, this won't do.

20:02.270 --> 20:04.570
We must take

20:05.030 --> 20:06.810
our responsibility.

20:07.030 --> 20:08.660
We must apologize to him.

20:09.550 --> 20:10.330
Moon Elder.

20:14.790 --> 20:15.570
Understood.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.810
Stellar Dreamweaver.

20:23.480 --> 20:26.090
Our dream-sending treasure.

20:26.110 --> 20:27.380
He's a mortal,

20:27.400 --> 20:29.010
so he will sleep and rest.

20:29.030 --> 20:30.810
Once this mortal falls asleep,

20:30.830 --> 20:32.860
we'll use the power of the Dreamweaver

20:33.030 --> 20:35.010
to lead him here in his dream.

20:35.400 --> 20:37.380
Then, you can properly apologize to him.

20:41.640 --> 20:42.460
I apologize?

20:43.160 --> 20:43.940
What's wrong?

20:44.000 --> 20:45.140
Then... you?

20:45.590 --> 20:46.380
He?

20:48.030 --> 20:48.860
I apologize?

20:49.030 --> 20:50.140
Of course.

20:50.880 --> 20:52.290
It must be you.

20:52.310 --> 20:53.860
Be sincere.

20:57.480 --> 20:58.250
Got it.

21:04.200 --> 21:05.810
That power is terrifying.

21:06.880 --> 21:09.530
Once in a dream, I'll be defenseless.

21:12.680 --> 21:14.250
I wonder which great deity it is,

21:14.270 --> 21:15.620
trying to ruin my cultivation.

21:17.440 --> 21:19.460
But I've planned for years.

21:19.480 --> 21:21.460
I can't let it all fall apart here.

21:23.720 --> 21:24.620
At worst,

21:26.310 --> 21:27.530
I just won't sleep.

21:27.980 --> 21:30.920
[Half a month later]

21:30.920 --> 21:31.730
Eastwood Duke,

21:32.310 --> 21:34.250
it's been half a month already.

21:34.680 --> 21:36.460
This thing's been dead silent.

21:36.830 --> 21:38.530
Is it broken or something?

21:40.310 --> 21:41.460
What do you know?

21:42.200 --> 21:44.940
You'd fall apart before it does.

21:47.110 --> 21:49.620
As long as this mortal is tired, weak,

21:49.640 --> 21:50.860
dazed, and distracted,

21:50.880 --> 21:52.380
with his mind wavering,

21:52.440 --> 21:54.180
this Stellar Dreamweaver

21:54.200 --> 21:55.940
can drag him into a dream instantly.

21:57.680 --> 21:59.250
But then again,

21:59.270 --> 22:01.010
this mortal is really annoying.

22:01.480 --> 22:03.180
It's already been half a month.

22:03.200 --> 22:05.770
How come he hasn't slackened at all?

22:05.790 --> 22:08.380
Doesn't he get tired living like this?

22:08.680 --> 22:10.530
It's been half a month already.

22:11.000 --> 22:13.010
If we keep putting off this apology,

22:13.480 --> 22:15.050
his arm will be fully healed.

22:15.440 --> 22:17.530
It seems he's not destined
to get an apology.

22:17.590 --> 22:18.860
Not destined? We'll make it destined.

22:24.110 --> 22:26.330
It's the Grand Mage's blunder.

22:26.480 --> 22:28.050
We must handle the aftermath properly.

22:28.240 --> 22:30.220
Otherwise, it'll be our failure.

22:30.920 --> 22:33.050
Whether his arm heals or not,

22:33.400 --> 22:35.530
we must take responsibility.

22:38.270 --> 22:40.010
Alright, I'm tired too.

22:41.070 --> 22:42.010
I need to go back and sleep.

22:42.110 --> 22:43.980
No, I need to go
sort out official duties.

22:44.440 --> 22:45.330
Keep a close watch.

22:45.400 --> 22:46.860
Watch until he loosens up.

22:49.030 --> 22:50.180
Goodbye, Eastwood Duke.

22:50.200 --> 22:50.980
I'll keep watch.

22:52.200 --> 22:53.460
This place is called Tiger's Mouth.

22:53.680 --> 22:55.620
If you're too sleepy to bear it,

22:55.640 --> 22:57.620
just pinch yourself a couple of times.

22:57.640 --> 22:58.490
Pinch hard.

22:58.510 --> 22:59.700
Ow! Ow!

23:00.270 --> 23:02.460
Don't worry. I'll keep a good watch.

23:03.070 --> 23:03.980
Rest assured.

23:04.640 --> 23:05.770
I'm wide awake.

23:08.700 --> 23:11.860
[Hall of United Spirits]

23:50.550 --> 23:52.380
I'm a cultivator.

23:52.880 --> 23:54.530
With my Qi going on,

23:55.030 --> 23:58.290
staying awake for years is nothing.

24:02.270 --> 24:03.660
Chattering in the dead of night!

24:03.680 --> 24:05.420
You cultivate, but others need sleep!

24:05.680 --> 24:06.460
Cultivate!

24:06.550 --> 24:07.570
Cultivate some decency!

24:07.590 --> 24:08.810
Have you no decency?

24:09.000 --> 24:09.980
You think I have no temper?

24:18.350 --> 24:19.140
Where is this?

24:21.000 --> 24:21.770
Just now...

24:33.270 --> 24:35.090
I've persevered for so long.

24:35.680 --> 24:36.940
How can I quit halfway?

24:39.030 --> 24:40.860
All sensual obstructions, break!

24:40.880 --> 24:41.620
Young man.

24:42.110 --> 24:42.810
Hold on!

24:42.830 --> 24:43.770
Young man, hold on!

24:43.790 --> 24:44.420
What the...?

24:44.440 --> 24:44.810
Young man.

24:44.830 --> 24:45.570
You... you...

24:45.680 --> 24:46.250
Young man.

24:46.880 --> 24:48.250
I've been waiting for you.

24:48.720 --> 24:49.570
Come, come, young man.

24:49.590 --> 24:50.050
What are you doing?

24:50.070 --> 24:51.330
Young man.

24:51.550 --> 24:52.700
Just look over here.

24:53.830 --> 24:54.570
Look here.

24:56.680 --> 24:57.180
Where is this?

24:58.000 --> 25:00.620
Red threads have no end,
yet flowers have masters.

25:01.030 --> 25:04.290
Love never ages;
the moon is forever round.

25:09.640 --> 25:10.620
Could this be...

25:10.750 --> 25:11.420
Exactly.

25:11.480 --> 25:14.660
Under a full moon,
beneath the Tree of Yearning,

25:14.680 --> 25:17.050
this is the Union Palace.

25:17.240 --> 25:19.050
I am the Moon Elder.

25:19.070 --> 25:22.810
Heaven decrees:
I rule Three Realms' marriages.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.220
Young man,

25:24.790 --> 25:28.010
I've long admired you from afar.

25:30.640 --> 25:32.370
Is my intro that moving?

25:32.390 --> 25:35.980
I love this sky so deeply.

25:37.150 --> 25:38.260
There, there, good kid. Don't cry.

25:38.280 --> 25:39.210
There, there.

25:39.720 --> 25:40.650
Don't cry.

25:43.480 --> 25:45.090
That's what happened.

25:45.920 --> 25:49.010
You're so selfless and magnanimous.

25:49.750 --> 25:50.700
[Li Changshou]
That's truly rare.

25:52.440 --> 25:53.420
It's fine.

25:54.880 --> 25:57.460
When others waste their time

25:57.480 --> 25:59.010
on idle thoughts,

25:59.030 --> 26:00.860
I put my time into cultivation.

26:01.200 --> 26:04.010
Since we know
your determination in cultivation,

26:04.240 --> 26:06.530
we won't press you.

26:07.350 --> 26:10.010
As for the Grand Mage of Voidcity,

26:10.440 --> 26:11.900
he won't mind

26:12.240 --> 26:13.490
such trifles.

26:14.880 --> 26:17.090
This involves the Grand Mage too?

26:17.110 --> 26:18.570
More than just involved.

26:18.640 --> 26:20.940
It's like tangled lotus roots.

26:20.960 --> 26:22.050
He's the real breaker

26:22.070 --> 26:22.490
of your...

26:25.680 --> 26:26.660
I didn't hear that. Understood.

26:26.750 --> 26:28.700
Well, the Celestial Court

26:28.830 --> 26:29.620
is newly founded.

26:30.110 --> 26:31.700
The Grand Mage of Voidcity
is a high immortal.

26:31.720 --> 26:33.460
It's only proper for him

26:33.480 --> 26:34.420
to tend to daily affairs.

26:34.440 --> 26:35.420
Of course, of course.

26:36.270 --> 26:37.770
I'll be honest with you.

26:38.400 --> 26:40.460
Since childhood,
I've longed for the Celestial Court.

26:40.750 --> 26:42.810
Now, to actually be here

26:42.830 --> 26:44.460
is truly a dream come true.

26:44.480 --> 26:45.770
I never imagined

26:45.830 --> 26:47.810
that our humble Celestial Court

26:48.070 --> 26:50.140
would have such a devoted admirer.

26:50.880 --> 26:53.810
Why not stay for a drink?

26:53.830 --> 26:55.730
I can tell you something
about the Celestial Court.

26:56.350 --> 26:57.330
Well...

26:58.030 --> 26:59.330
A little drink.

26:59.550 --> 27:00.330
Just a little drink.

27:01.240 --> 27:01.900
Then,

27:03.830 --> 27:04.810
let's have a little drink.

27:15.960 --> 27:17.620
Let me tell you, Changshou.

27:18.240 --> 27:19.730
I'm having such a hard time.

27:20.270 --> 27:22.490
I've been on duty here
for thousands of years.

27:22.510 --> 27:25.010
I haven't had a single day off.

27:25.030 --> 27:26.140
And they'd even have you

27:26.160 --> 27:28.570
work 24 hours a day.

27:28.590 --> 27:30.140
Not even a stick of incense's rest.

27:30.960 --> 27:33.900
The quota for the Book
of Marriages is so high.

27:33.920 --> 27:36.530
How can a little old man like me
finish it all?

27:36.790 --> 27:38.460
And if you can't finish,
you'll be punished.

27:38.510 --> 27:39.730
He never stops to think

27:39.750 --> 27:41.220
how absurd those quotas are, right?

27:41.240 --> 27:42.010
Also,

27:42.240 --> 27:43.810
nowadays,

27:43.830 --> 27:45.700
why do you mortals stop falling in love?

27:45.750 --> 27:48.010
Well, work and life pressure is huge.

27:48.030 --> 27:49.330
There's just no time.

27:49.350 --> 27:51.090
No time?

27:51.110 --> 27:52.220
If you don't fall in love,

27:52.240 --> 27:54.490
I just can't meet my matchmaking quota.

27:54.510 --> 27:55.860
If I can't meet my quota,

27:55.880 --> 27:58.220
Eastwood Duke will really scold me.

27:58.830 --> 27:59.620
Why don't you

27:59.640 --> 28:02.250
just fall in love, huh?

28:02.590 --> 28:05.220
Alright, I understand.

28:05.240 --> 28:06.220
I get you.

28:06.340 --> 28:06.730
Here.

28:12.030 --> 28:12.700
However,

28:13.640 --> 28:15.220
speaking of which, Changshou,

28:16.830 --> 28:18.810
I've been in the Celestial Court
for ages.

28:19.160 --> 28:22.180
This is the first time
someone's had a drink

28:22.200 --> 28:23.490
and chatted with me.

28:25.640 --> 28:26.420
Moon Elder,

28:27.590 --> 28:29.090
as long as you want,

28:29.720 --> 28:33.140
I'll come to your dreams after I sleep

28:33.160 --> 28:34.180
to drink with you.

28:34.920 --> 28:36.860
Don't just come in your dreams.

28:37.310 --> 28:39.940
Take a post at the Celestial Court.

28:40.200 --> 28:42.460
Come work with me.

28:42.720 --> 28:44.570
How fine to drink with me face-to-face.

28:50.200 --> 28:51.220
Moon Elder,

28:51.750 --> 28:53.290
there you go joking again.

28:53.440 --> 28:56.140
The Celestial Court is so lofty.

28:56.240 --> 28:58.380
I'm just a junior.

28:58.750 --> 29:00.050
I dare not dream of it.

29:00.070 --> 29:01.900
Lofty, my foot.

29:02.590 --> 29:04.730
Be it heaven or earth, work is work.

29:04.750 --> 29:05.570
Right?

29:05.790 --> 29:06.460
Let me tell you.

29:07.240 --> 29:08.050
Some affairs

29:08.640 --> 29:10.860
are beyond the control

29:11.030 --> 29:13.220
of the Celestial Court.

29:13.240 --> 29:14.050
Why?

29:14.160 --> 29:15.010
It lacks hands.

29:15.030 --> 29:16.900
There's too much to oversee.

29:16.920 --> 29:18.420
So, it simply can't manage.

29:19.030 --> 29:19.570
Well,

29:20.310 --> 29:22.420
may I ask

29:22.720 --> 29:23.620
one thing?

29:24.030 --> 29:27.860
What does the Celestial Court
want to control?

29:27.880 --> 29:30.090
It wants to control a lot of things.

29:30.110 --> 29:32.730
For example, Eastwood Duke

29:33.440 --> 29:34.770
has recently been worried
about one person.

29:34.790 --> 29:35.490
Tell me about it.

29:36.030 --> 29:36.810
Go on.

29:36.920 --> 29:37.940
She's called

29:38.590 --> 29:39.770
Fairy Yunxiao.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.490
Fairy Yunxiao?

29:43.590 --> 29:44.460
You know her?

29:45.960 --> 29:46.860
No.

29:46.880 --> 29:48.900
How could I possibly know an immortal?

29:49.240 --> 29:50.140
Exactly.

29:50.200 --> 29:53.220
Fairy Yunxiao is so high above.

29:53.310 --> 29:57.860
How could a Human Clan disciple
know her?

29:57.880 --> 29:58.570
Yes.

29:59.310 --> 30:02.250
Then, tell me.

30:03.110 --> 30:06.220
What is Fairy Yunxiao's background?

30:07.160 --> 30:08.530
Let me tell you

30:09.110 --> 30:11.660
about Fairy Yunxiao's

30:13.070 --> 30:14.980
background.

30:15.070 --> 30:17.050
Fairy Yunxiao

30:17.680 --> 30:21.810
is the first cloud given form.

30:22.880 --> 30:26.140
She was born a Quasi-Saint.

30:26.440 --> 30:29.140
Then she joined the Seizing Sect

30:29.160 --> 30:30.940
under Heavenreach Master,

30:31.200 --> 30:34.900
known as the mightiest war goddess.

30:36.510 --> 30:37.620
At first,

30:37.830 --> 30:41.620
Fairy Yunxiao never fought for anything.

30:41.830 --> 30:44.180
But for some reason,

30:44.200 --> 30:47.570
she's become a different person.

30:47.590 --> 30:50.860
She roams around plundering

30:50.960 --> 30:53.620
magic instruments.

30:53.640 --> 30:55.980
A lovely young girl,

30:56.270 --> 30:58.940
now a wicked fiend.

31:00.830 --> 31:01.660
Yunxiao!

31:03.440 --> 31:04.220
Yunxiao!

31:05.510 --> 31:06.290
Yunxiao!

31:07.920 --> 31:08.660
Senior,

31:08.680 --> 31:10.090
is Yunxiao back?

31:10.160 --> 31:11.810
She was just here.

31:12.310 --> 31:14.290
All these years, not a word.

31:14.290 --> 31:16.480
[Zhao Gongming, Seizing Sect]

31:16.480 --> 31:17.570
Where did she go?

31:19.440 --> 31:21.490
She could at least have told us.

31:25.440 --> 31:26.940
I see.

31:27.400 --> 31:28.980
No wonder she's so formidable.

31:29.070 --> 31:31.570
At first, the Celestial Court wanted

31:32.240 --> 31:33.140
to curb her actions.

31:33.960 --> 31:36.420
But Fairy Yunxiao

31:36.680 --> 31:38.620
is elusive.

31:38.640 --> 31:39.420
We can't find her.

31:39.440 --> 31:41.420
Besides, she's too powerful.

31:41.440 --> 31:42.330
She can't be tamed.

31:44.200 --> 31:45.980
So, the Celestial Court let it be.

31:46.270 --> 31:49.180
But something's happened recently.

31:49.400 --> 31:51.940
The Celestial Court had to act.

31:56.480 --> 31:57.460
Recently,

31:58.440 --> 31:59.660
Fairy Yunxiao

32:00.920 --> 32:03.090
has been searching

32:04.110 --> 32:06.180
for the Sea-Calming Pillar.

32:06.720 --> 32:07.900
The Sea-Calming Pillar?

32:08.240 --> 32:09.620
Isn't that the Golden Cudgel?

32:11.000 --> 32:11.770
What cudgel?

32:12.160 --> 32:12.940
Who's great?

32:12.960 --> 32:13.730
You're great.

32:14.030 --> 32:14.980
You misheard.

32:15.640 --> 32:17.770
You might not know

32:17.790 --> 32:19.380
about the Sea-Calming Pillar.

32:20.110 --> 32:24.010
It was here before Pangu

32:24.030 --> 32:25.010
created the world.

32:25.310 --> 32:26.770
Even now, no one knows

32:26.790 --> 32:29.220
where the Sea-Calming Pillar
actually is.

32:30.240 --> 32:32.050
In all the Three Realms,

32:32.070 --> 32:34.330
fewer than ten know.

32:35.160 --> 32:36.620
Shouldn't it be in the East Sea?

32:39.030 --> 32:39.810
You know?

32:42.440 --> 32:43.460
I guessed.

32:44.590 --> 32:45.620
Don't you know?

32:45.640 --> 32:46.220
You...

32:46.240 --> 32:47.420
How would I know?

32:47.790 --> 32:49.380
Do I look like someone

32:49.590 --> 32:51.090
ranked in the top ten

32:51.510 --> 32:52.980
of the Three Realms?

32:53.000 --> 32:54.220
Why wouldn't you?

32:54.790 --> 32:55.940
To me, you seem

32:55.960 --> 32:57.530
more like the top three.

32:59.790 --> 33:01.140
You sweet-talker.

33:06.640 --> 33:07.180
Moon Elder.

33:08.030 --> 33:08.570
Well.

33:09.640 --> 33:10.860
Let me boldly ask

33:11.240 --> 33:14.050
another question.

33:14.790 --> 33:17.140
If I

33:18.440 --> 33:22.700
help the Celestial Court

33:23.240 --> 33:24.620
settle this Fairy Yunxiao matter,

33:24.720 --> 33:26.420
would the Celestial Court then

33:26.920 --> 33:27.940
notice me?

33:30.240 --> 33:31.090
You're drunk.

33:31.720 --> 33:32.460
Just kidding.

33:32.480 --> 33:34.290
Starting to brag, huh?

33:34.640 --> 33:38.380
If you can handle Fairy Yunxiao,

33:38.640 --> 33:41.330
forget about working for me.

33:41.640 --> 33:43.770
You'll just become a high immortal.

33:44.640 --> 33:47.050
You'll be my boss.

33:47.880 --> 33:49.010
My boss...

33:54.000 --> 33:54.770
My boss.

34:10.000 --> 34:12.610
Thirty years of effort finally paid off.

34:12.630 --> 34:14.380
The road ahead is bright.

34:14.630 --> 34:16.340
Now, I just need to head
to the East Sea,

34:16.360 --> 34:17.980
find the Sea-Calming Pillar,
and guard it.

34:18.000 --> 34:20.650
Then, I'll rise to the top.

34:23.360 --> 34:24.130
What's this?

34:25.590 --> 34:26.460
The Tribulation Cloud?

34:27.760 --> 34:28.530
Could it be

34:29.070 --> 34:30.690
Mentor's Tribulation Cloud?

34:37.150 --> 34:39.050
Why are there such dark clouds

34:39.070 --> 34:41.050
gathering above our sect?

34:41.070 --> 34:42.170
Who's facing the Tribulation?

34:43.960 --> 34:44.820
Could it be

34:45.150 --> 34:47.300
someone's facing the Tribulation?

34:48.760 --> 34:49.570
Here, Mentor.

34:49.800 --> 34:51.050
You need all this.

34:51.710 --> 34:52.490
Here.

34:53.110 --> 34:54.130
Put them all here.

34:55.000 --> 34:55.690
Senior,

34:55.710 --> 34:57.860
why not let Mentor face it
in Jade Division?

34:57.880 --> 34:59.490
The Griefbane Division is
the sect's main division.

34:59.510 --> 35:01.490
Outside, the Protective Array
will activate.

35:01.510 --> 35:02.980
Maybe it can reduce
the lightning's impact.

35:03.000 --> 35:03.420
Alright, alright.

35:04.190 --> 35:04.820
Here, Mentor.

35:05.590 --> 35:05.860
Here.

35:05.880 --> 35:06.900
Here, Mentor, take this.

35:07.440 --> 35:08.860
Take this Settlebreath Pill.

35:09.590 --> 35:11.420
And the Jadevoid Powder,
Dragon-Tiger Potion.

35:11.440 --> 35:12.170
Primordial Pill.

35:12.190 --> 35:12.820
Open up.

35:12.920 --> 35:14.210
This is a Lightning Rod.

35:14.230 --> 35:15.210
According to research,

35:15.230 --> 35:16.650
Thunderfall Wood can weaken

35:16.670 --> 35:17.610
the Tribulation by 36%.

35:17.630 --> 35:18.820
Take the Settlebreath Pill now.

35:19.000 --> 35:19.460
Right.

35:20.800 --> 35:21.780
Hurry, open wide, Mentor.

35:22.280 --> 35:24.010
Chew, chew. Yes, yes.

35:24.630 --> 35:26.610
What are you doing to me?

35:26.920 --> 35:28.300
Helping you survive the Tribulation!

35:36.630 --> 35:37.460
Despite all our planning,

35:37.480 --> 35:39.530
your Tribulation Clouds came so soon.

35:39.550 --> 35:41.610
Good thing we were well-prepared.

35:44.150 --> 35:45.300
Mentor, don't worry.

35:45.320 --> 35:46.490
These items on you

35:46.510 --> 35:47.740
will shield you
from five lightning strikes.

35:47.760 --> 35:49.380
- Yes, and this.
- I got a birdcage too.

35:49.400 --> 35:49.820
At worst...

35:49.840 --> 35:51.460
Are you the mentor, or am I?

35:54.480 --> 35:54.980
Mentor...

35:55.280 --> 35:55.860
Mentor...

35:59.960 --> 36:01.860
I know you're worried about me.

36:02.960 --> 36:04.570
I understand your intentions.

36:05.230 --> 36:07.170
But the Tribulation is a pivotal trial.

36:09.280 --> 36:11.090
I must endure it with my body

36:11.840 --> 36:14.090
to bear each bolt of thunder.

36:15.110 --> 36:16.820
Only then can I gain Fate's recognition.

36:17.710 --> 36:20.780
Only then can I say

36:22.480 --> 36:24.490
that I am a true cultivator.

36:25.030 --> 36:25.940
But Mentor...

36:25.960 --> 36:26.570
I know.

36:28.670 --> 36:29.940
I know you are afraid.

36:31.550 --> 36:32.690
I'm afraid too.

36:35.280 --> 36:36.490
When thunder strikes,

36:38.710 --> 36:39.940
my end will be decided.

36:43.110 --> 36:45.090
I'm not afraid of failing the trial.

36:46.590 --> 36:47.570
I'm afraid of...

36:51.400 --> 36:54.210
I'm afraid that if I never return,

36:59.280 --> 37:01.820
how you two rascals

37:03.630 --> 37:05.420
will carry on alone.

37:10.230 --> 37:11.010
Mentor.

37:15.070 --> 37:17.090
Whether I live or die,

37:17.960 --> 37:19.260
it is all the heavenly mandate.

37:20.800 --> 37:22.780
We must face the heavenly mandate,

37:23.320 --> 37:25.260
instead of resorting to heterodox ways.

37:27.320 --> 37:30.860
This is a cultivator's righteous heart.

37:32.920 --> 37:34.380
This is also

37:35.590 --> 37:37.210
my final lesson for you.

37:38.800 --> 37:39.570
Changshou.

37:39.880 --> 37:40.650
I'm here.

37:40.840 --> 37:42.300
Take good care of your junior.

37:43.840 --> 37:45.340
Don't let her suffer again.

37:47.480 --> 37:49.780
I'll be back soon.

37:50.510 --> 37:51.650
If I don't return,

37:53.840 --> 37:55.050
on festive days,

37:56.030 --> 37:57.900
light a stick of incense for me.

38:00.840 --> 38:04.170
When the incense burns out
and smoke curls,

38:07.510 --> 38:09.530
it's me coming to see you.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.300
Mentor,

38:14.280 --> 38:15.340
I obey.

38:21.760 --> 38:23.690
Kids, look.

38:26.440 --> 38:27.740
I never thought

38:28.710 --> 38:31.050
my Tribulation Cloud

38:31.230 --> 38:33.860
would be magnificent.

38:35.610 --> 38:37.360
♪I know the world's full of deceit♪

38:37.360 --> 38:38.130
Mentor.

38:38.130 --> 38:40.180
♪Put on a good show♪

38:40.620 --> 38:45.250
♪Why not change forms and play♪

38:45.810 --> 38:48.000
♪I wish to view the world as art♪

38:48.000 --> 38:50.190
♪But the years are full of chaos♪

38:50.490 --> 38:54.830
♪Caught in karma, stained by dust♪

38:55.800 --> 38:58.090
Whether I'm alive or dead,

38:58.840 --> 39:00.490
whether I make it or not,

39:01.840 --> 39:03.210
today,

39:04.400 --> 39:06.490
I'll accept it all calmly.

39:09.040 --> 39:11.120
♪Let them all come♪

39:11.120 --> 39:15.140
♪There's a perfect plan for everything♪

39:15.340 --> 39:17.290
♪Who's clamoring behind♪

39:18.000 --> 39:20.020
♪Acting like fierce demons♪

39:21.320 --> 39:23.610
Strike!

39:24.550 --> 39:26.860
Come on!

39:32.400 --> 39:34.490
Strike!

39:35.840 --> 39:39.260
Come on!

39:53.630 --> 39:56.460
Come on!

39:57.400 --> 39:58.300
Well.

39:58.800 --> 40:00.820
I'm the Turtle Minister of the East Sea,

40:01.030 --> 40:03.420
here to convey the Dragon King's decree.

40:03.440 --> 40:04.610
I'm here to...

40:05.360 --> 40:06.260
Well...

40:19.070 --> 40:20.860
This is the Human Clan's etiquette?

40:21.320 --> 40:22.090
Understood.

41:12.110 --> 41:13.420
The snow stopped.

41:19.150 --> 41:20.900
You don't understand.

41:27.480 --> 41:29.210
It's been so long since we last met.

41:30.000 --> 41:32.460
The Human Clan is so polite.

41:32.590 --> 41:35.210
It warms my heart.

41:45.070 --> 41:46.980
This is the Ascendance Sect?

41:49.800 --> 41:50.570
What are

41:52.150 --> 41:53.210
all these things?

41:53.630 --> 41:54.420
Your Highness,

41:55.320 --> 41:56.380
they're humans.

41:58.880 --> 42:01.010
So this is

42:01.920 --> 42:02.690
human.

42:05.880 --> 42:09.610
Welcome, Prince Ao Jia

42:09.880 --> 42:11.780
of the East Sea.

42:46.280 --> 42:52.060
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

42:52.730 --> 42:59.430
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

43:00.960 --> 43:07.010
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

43:07.640 --> 43:14.090
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

43:14.830 --> 43:21.950
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:22.330 --> 43:29.230
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:29.610 --> 43:36.960
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

43:36.960 --> 43:44.130
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

44:00.270 --> 44:05.440
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

44:06.530 --> 44:13.550
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

44:14.740 --> 44:20.680
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

44:21.380 --> 44:28.460
♪Alas, our story is short♪

44:28.800 --> 44:35.910
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

44:36.230 --> 44:42.710
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

44:43.490 --> 44:50.700
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

44:51.090 --> 44:58.910
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
